  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.2.0: layout primitives and scope helpers. New Rect value type plus FPdf.Row / Stack / Panel for composing pages without (x + width + gap) arithmetic. PanelStyle records capture frame + title looks as reusable data. PushState / PushPos return IDisposable scopes that auto-restore font, colour, line-width and cursor state. Bounds() returns the printable area as a Rect. Bug fixes: GetStringWidth falls back to the \"A\" glyph width for missing characters instead of throwing KeyNotFoundException; GoBack(GoBackMode) now honours the X / Y / Both selector. Fully additive over 2.1.0.",
